20A6 DDD0             (   demo/cubed.asm):00153                         STD     <PA             ; PA, PB
20A8 EC02             (   demo/cubed.asm):00154                         LDD     2,X
20AA DDD2             (   demo/cubed.asm):00155                         STD     <PC             ; PC, PS
